  html:not(.fs-trade):not(.is-fullscreen) body #screenTrade#screenTrade#screenTrade #tradeWrap#tradeWrap#tradeWrap:not(#z1):not(#z2):not(#z3) #oddsRow .odds-chip:nth-child(1){width:42px!important;height:42px!important;min-width:42px!important;min-height:42px!important;max-width:42px!important;max-height:42px!important}
